 -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  WHAT THIS IS
 -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

  An installer that lays down a whole machine: ZFS root with boot environments,
  a hypervisor, a Kubernetes cluster, golden images of five distributions, the
  metrics stack and the tools to run them. It carries every package it needs on
  the media, so a rack can be provisioned with no internet at all.

  Nobody presses a button. You answer the questions once, or hand it an answers
  file, and come back to a machine that has already built itself.

 -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  THE INSTALL
 -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

  1. boot the media, or netboot the rack from a machine that already has it
  2. the show runs while the system is written to disk
  3. one reboot
  4. if you asked for Kubernetes, images or models, the show comes back and
     holds the screen until the build is done, with the live log inside it
  5. it hands you a finished machine

  Lean installs skip step 4 and come straight up, because they are ready.

 -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
